Package: luci-app-uptime-kuma
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: luci-base
Section: luci
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Silens Wong <silenseek14@gmail.com>
Description: LuCI shell for the uptime-kuma service
 Start/stop/restart the local uptime-kuma service, edit its listen address,
 port and data directory, read its log tail, open the monitoring panel in a
 new tab and create an on-demand backup of the data directory.
 The monitoring UI itself stays Uptime Kuma's own web app: it is never
 embedded in LuCI (it sends X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN).
